WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:03.010
The One Piece Manga Has Finally revealed most
of the Blackbeard Pirates’ completely overpowered

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:06.000
Devil Fruits, that Teach and his crew have
been collecting since the war at marineford.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.319
And so for the first time in One Piece history
we have a pretty good idea about the true

00:00:07.319 --> 00:00:08.319
powers of each of the 10 Titanic Captains,
what their position in the emperor’s crew

00:00:08.319 --> 00:00:09.319
is, and what straw hat they will most likely
match up with once the inevitable battle between

00:00:09.319 --> 00:00:10.319
the two crews takes place on Laugh Tale. And
at the end I will of course also discuss Blackbeard

00:00:10.319 --> 00:00:11.319
himself and all the new information we got
about the main and most anticipated antagonist

00:00:11.319 --> 00:00:12.319
in the entire story.

00:00:12.319 --> 00:00:13.319
And coming in at number 11, we of course have
to talk about Kuzan, formerly known as admiral

00:00:13.319 --> 00:00:14.660
Aokiji, who has now finally been confirmed
as an active member of Blackbeard’s crew,

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:19.410
something that has been hinted by one of the
Gorosei after Aokiji lost the battle for the

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.660
fleet admiral position against Akainu.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:26.599
Kuzan wields the powerful hie hie no mi, a
Logia fruit, that turns its user into true

00:00:26.599 --> 00:00:32.310
coldness. Aokiji can cool down anything around
him, including the ocean itself turning it

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:37.370
to ice, making him the only known devil fruit
user, who would be immune to falling into

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:42.399
the ocean. This, as well as his former admiral
status, most likely make him the most powerful

00:00:42.399 --> 00:00:48.010
subordinate Blackbeard has in his crew at
this moment, with ridiculously overpowered

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:49.990
devil fruit and haki abilities.

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:54.850
Kuzan’s cahracter is inspired by the actor
Yasuka Matsuda, especially in his role of

00:00:54.850 --> 00:01:01.790
Detective Shunsaku Kudo, that is just an in
real life version of Aokiji. His epithet literally

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:07.360
means blue pheasant, which is inspired by
both his ice powers as well as the story of

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:12.350
Momotaro, who was accompanied by a Dog, a
monkey and a pheasant, which also gets you

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:15.890
the red dog akainu and the yellow monkey Kizaru.

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:21.250
As for Aokiji’s role in the crew, it’s
really hard to say, what his actual position

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.520
is, as we just found out that he is an official
member. However out of the 10 Titanic Captains

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:32.100
in Blackbeard’s crew, we only know 9 of
them, so it wouldn’t be too far fetched

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:36.810
i think to assume that Kuzan might be the
titanic captain of the 10th ship.

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:42.870
But why on earth did a former marine admiral
join one of the most evil pirate groups on

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:44.579
the planet in the first place?

00:01:44.579 --> 00:01:49.610
I think it’s pretty fair to say that Kuzan
is the odd one out in a crew of fairly odd

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:54.310
pirates. While he was Luffy’s antagonist
during the long ring island arc and later

00:01:54.310 --> 00:01:59.060
at Marineford, Eiichiro Oda, the author of
one piece, has made it pretty clear to us,

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:04.539
that Kuzan was more of an ally to the crew.
He was the one who spared Robin’s life after

00:02:04.539 --> 00:02:10.280
the events on Ohara and was cheering for her
to find a place where she belongs. Aokiji’s

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:15.800
entire arc during the Water seven Enies Lobby
arc was literally a test for the straw hats,

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:21.730
to see if they could be entrusted with Robin’s
life, as he explains himself. He sees his

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:28.160
idol Garp, Luffy’s grandfather in the straw
hat captain and starts to cheer for him, always

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:33.861
finding an excuse to spare them. He freezes
Robin and Luffy, but then just leaves. He

00:02:33.861 --> 00:02:38.430
has a heartwarming chat with Robin after the
crew saved her from Enies Lobby and makes

00:02:38.430 --> 00:02:44.880
sure that everyone who helped Luffy infiltrate
the island is categorizes as an innocent bystander.

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:49.659
He just lies down in his sun bed, as garp
lets his grandson escape and smiles at the

00:02:49.659 --> 00:02:55.280
crew’s new ship. And even at Marine ford,
he saves Luffy’s life twice, first jumping

00:02:55.280 --> 00:03:00.290
in to attack luffy with a basic stab attack
when Akainu is getting ready to take Luffy

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:06.470
out and later letting Law’s submarine escape
as they treat the heavily wounded Luffy. So

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:11.750
overall, Kuzan is presented to us as one of
the most powerful Marine fighters, that sympathizes

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:16.450
with Luffy’s journey, because Luffy’s
and his sense of justice overlap.

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:22.379
And yet, after all that, after losing the
battle with Akainu he joins none other than

00:03:22.379 --> 00:03:27.650
Blackbeard, Luffy’s polar opposite and a
man with no sense of morale and justice what

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:33.010
so ever. The 3 most likely explanations here
are that, one, he has truly changed his ways

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:37.930
and is looking for revenge on the Marines,
two, he is an undercover agent FOR the marines

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:43.950
and his fight with Akainu was staged to get
him into the crew, or 3, Kuzan is now actually

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:49.700
working with or for someone else, for example
the Revolutionaries, to keep an eye on Blackbeard

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:53.519
and assure he doesn’t succeed with his mission
to rule the world.

00:03:53.519 --> 00:03:58.330
I personally find it really hard to believe
that Kuzan is not a good guy, who will actually

00:03:58.330 --> 00:04:03.970
come to help Luffy and his crew and turn on
Blackbeard sooner or later. He might even

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:08.750
be the person who reveals the decive detail
of how to bring Teach down in the end. So

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:14.150
once the Straw hats cross paths with the Blackbeard
pirates, I don’t expect Kuzan to fight anyone

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:16.340
at all, but if anything, switch sides.

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:19.419
At number 10 we have Jesus Burgess.

00:04:19.419 --> 00:04:24.220
Burges is one of the devil fruits that have
just been revealed in the Manga. Some time

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:30.020
after the events at Dressrosa, he has eaten
the RIki Riki no mi, a paramecia, that grants

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:36.900
superhuman strength. This comes in especially
handy, because it multiplies Burgess’ already

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:42.900
superhuman base strength to a level where
he’s able to easily lift an entire mountain

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:50.310
and casually throw it. This makes him the
physically strongest member in the crew.

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:55.919
Jesus Burgess is inspired by the classic mexican
wrestler, including the mask and all. Thus

00:04:55.919 --> 00:05:00.120
when his face is shown as unmasked for the
first time, we actually don’t really see

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:06.100
it fully, because similar to the mandalorian,
it is shameful in Luchador culture to be unmasked

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:11.470
and having ones true identity revealed. The
name Burgess is most likely inspired by the

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:17.430
real life pirates Samuel&nbsp;and&nbsp;Josiah Burgess.
Jesus is both a traditional spanish name,

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:23.910
but funnily enough, Oda also gave Burgess
christmas day as his actual birthday in reference

00:05:23.910 --> 00:05:25.490
to actual Jesus.

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:31.360
There is pretty much nothing we know yet about
Burgess’ background. He was one of the original

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:36.229
members of the crew and joined Blackbeard
due to his passion for fighting strong opponents.

00:05:36.229 --> 00:05:41.430
He is the helmsman of the crew and captain
of the first ship, suggesting that he might

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:44.169
have been Teach’s first member.

00:05:44.169 --> 00:05:49.030
While some people have thrown Sanji in as
a potential opponent for him, I like to think

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:54.820
that as Helmsman of the crew, Burgess will
fight Jinbei, the helmsman of the straw hats.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:59.210
Both of them having the stature of a wrestler
and practicing martial arts.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:04.280
Number 9 is Shiryu of the rain, probably my
personal favorite in the crew.

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:10.160
Shiriyu has eaten the Suke Suke no mi, a paramecia
devil fruit that renders its user invisible.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:14.340
This fruit was taken from its previous user
Absalom in the crew’s hunt for powerful

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:20.560
devil fruits. Its stealth abilities are beyond
convenient and give Shiriyu a strong tactical

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:25.930
advantage over his opponents. Together with
his superb swordsman skills, Oda has revealed

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:31.509
that Shiriyu has become Teach’s right hand
man and the second strongest member of the

00:06:31.509 --> 00:06:38.300
crew after his captain. Since Aokiji was not
revealed at this point and because he most

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:43.050
likely isn’t an actual member anyways, we
don’t have to break our heads figuring out

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:46.460
who of the two is actually more powerful right
now.

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:51.240
Shiriyu doesn’t seem to have any obvious
inspiration at first glance. However his Japanese

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:57.560
name and katana as well as his epithet ‘of
the rain’ strongly hint at Shiryu being

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:02.620
a former citizen of Wano. That would of course
perfectly explain his excellent sword fighting

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:07.789
skills, that make him the swordsman and captain
of the second ship of the blackbeard pirates.

00:07:07.789 --> 00:07:13.150
Before Magelan, Shiriyu used to be the head
jailor of Impel Down, the government’s terrifying

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:18.849
prison of death and torture, where each of
its 6 levels is modeled after Dante’s inferno,

00:07:18.849 --> 00:07:26.620
in other words literally hell. And yet somehow,
Shiriyu was deemed to be too brutal and cruel

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:32.900
for a place, that already seems to be the
most brual and violent place in One PIece:

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:37.340
As a result for his methods, he was sentenced
to death and thrown into level 6, the secret

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:42.379
deepest level, where those were being kept
who’s crimes were to terrible or embarrassing

00:07:42.379 --> 00:07:46.949
for the government to be made public. During
Luffy’s breakout, Magelan reluctantly chose

00:07:46.949 --> 00:07:52.430
to release Shiryu temporarily to have him
help quench the uprising. Instead, once Shiriyu

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:57.759
got his hands on his sword, he immediately
killed his guards and cut off all communication

00:07:57.759 --> 00:08:03.050
to the outside of the prison, fearing that
Magelan might come down. After Blackbeard

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:08.409
and his men were dying from Magellan’s poison,
Shiriyu brought them the antidote and accepted

00:08:08.409 --> 00:08:13.150
Blackbeard’s second invite to join his crew.
He then helped them reach level 6 to pick

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:15.169
the strongest inmates for the crew.

00:08:15.169 --> 00:08:20.110
Shiriyuu is clearly in for his insane bloodlust
and manice. Since the government deprived

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:25.720
him of it, he now joined Blackbeard that gives
him new opportunities to live out his worst

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:26.720
instincts.

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:30.940
It seems pretty straight forward than, that
as a samurai and the second Strongest in the

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:37.450
crew, Shiryu will face Zoro and possibly be
his biggest challenge in the story together

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:38.450
with Mihawk.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:42.110
Coming it at 8 is Van Augur.
Another member who’s devil fruit has been

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:47.990
freshly revealed. He has eaten the Wapu Wapu
no mi, a paramecia fruit that literally allows

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:54.959
teleportation both of himself and others.
This is of course a perfect fit with his sniping

00:08:54.959 --> 00:08:59.899
abilities. Van augur has incredible precision
and is able to take out moving targets from

00:08:59.899 --> 00:09:05.710
miles away, which he demonstrates on Jaya
as he takes out sea gulls flying off the coast

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:11.100
of the island. These sea gulls have done nothing
wrong. Why would you. Anyways, the fruit also

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:15.779
allows the Blackbeard pirates to quickly change
locations or bring a target of theirs close

00:09:15.779 --> 00:09:21.360
to them. This allows van augur to teleport
his victim where-ever he wants and then simply

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:23.450
shoot them.

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:27.519
Both his outfit and design as well as his
sniping powers are inspired by the character

00:09:27.519 --> 00:09:33.100
Adolphus from Terry Gilliam's film,&nbsp;The Adventures
of Baron Munchausen. Adolphus is one of the

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:37.880
Baron's henchmen, with perfect eyesight and
flawless shooting skills, able to detach an

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:45.070
apple from a tree about nine hundred miles
away. His name is inspired by the both, the

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:50.339
real life pirate,&nbsp;John Auger, as well as
the augurs, who were roman priests that would

00:09:50.339 --> 00:09:54.850
read the future by interpreting the flight
patterns of birds, which fits pretty well

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:56.120
with his introduction.

00:09:56.120 --> 00:10:00.250
He is both the crew’s sniper and captain
of the third ship.

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:04.579
We don’t actually know anything about Van
Augur’s past yet, apart from him being the

00:10:04.579 --> 00:10:10.269
only member from the east blue, a sea that
seems to produce a lot of high quality snipers

00:10:10.269 --> 00:10:11.269
somehow.

00:10:11.269 --> 00:10:16.540
of course the only suitable opponent for him
is going to be the straw Hat’s sniper Usopp.

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:21.360
Next we have number 7, the corrupt king: Alvaro
Pizzaro.

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:25.959
There is pretty much nothing that we know
about Pizzaro’s powers except that as one

00:10:25.959 --> 00:10:31.370
of the level 6 impel down prisoners he must
be extremely powerful. He was even confident

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:35.930
enough to try and take command from Blackbeard
at some point. He looks a lot like some of

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:41.030
the beast pirates, including the horns, which
could suggest a zoan type fruit, but there

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:42.339
is no way of saying.

00:10:42.339 --> 00:10:48.769
Pizzaro is inspired by Francisco Pizzaro,
the spanish conquistador that conquered peru

00:10:48.769 --> 00:10:54.040
and destroyed the inca kingdom. Which is very
fitting as Alavaro Pizzaro used to be king

00:10:54.040 --> 00:11:00.120
of a country in the north blue, that overthrew
him for his cruel way of ruling. In the end

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:05.480
he actually got his wish granted of becoming
a captain, as he now commands the fourth ship

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:06.770
of the blackbeard pirates.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:11.170
SInce we know nothing about his powers and
fighting style, the most likely match up I

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:17.000
have for him is Sanji, as he seems to be quite
powerful in the hirachy of the crew. He also

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:22.320
used to be a cruel ruler, which as we know,
should create some real PTSD for Sanji and

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:25.100
growing up under his terrible father judge.

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:28.230
Number 5 is the Demon Sheriff: Lafitte.

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:34.190
Lafitte doesn’t have an official devil fruit
yet, but we have seen him flying with giant

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:38.890
white angel like wings. This could of course
mean that he is part of one of the winged

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:44.490
races or alternatively that he has eaten some
sort of winged devil fruit. Maybe that of

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:51.060
an angel, which would be nice and ironic with
his devil slash demon epithet. Lafitte looks

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:55.451
quite fragile, but seems to be quite powerful,
he is capable of hypnotizing people, which

00:11:55.451 --> 00:12:05.399
might make Jango relevant again at some point
in the story* and he was also able to invade

00:12:05.399 --> 00:12:11.260
Marijois completely undetected until he made
himself be known during the warlord conference.

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:15.320
Lafitte is inspired by the real pirate brothers
Jean and Pierre Lafitte.

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:20.000
He used to be a police officer in the west
blue, until he was exiled for his repeated

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:22.450
police violence and cruelty.

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:27.850
Lafitte is also the original navigator of
the blackbeard pirates, which seems to put

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:33.370
him up against Nami, which i find an incredibly
interesting matchup, especially since nami

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:36.010
also uses illusions to fight her opponents.

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:42.130
Coming in at number 6 is the crecent moon
hunter: Catarina Devon, the only woman in

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:44.420
the top echelon of Blackbeard’s crew.

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:50.120
Devon has eaten the mythical Dog Dog Fruit
model Nine Tailed Fox. As a Kitsune, she is

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:55.800
able to shapeshift into other people, arguably
making her an advanced version of Bon kurei’s

00:12:55.800 --> 00:13:00.220
fruit. Interestingly enough, Devon was once
the worst female criminal within the Golden

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:05.540
Age of Piracy before she got send to impel
down, which is fascinating, because Big Mom

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:07.220
was a thing then too.

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:11.660
Her name might be inspired by the spanish
conquistador Catallina De Erauso. In early

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:18.860
concepts released in an sbs, Oda planned her
to be a cute fox girl as a member of the original

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:24.029
Blackbeard pirates. However, in the end he
wanted the crew to look more authentic, rough

00:13:24.029 --> 00:13:30.180
and vulgar and changed her design, turnign
the cute fox furry theme into a devil fruit.

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:31.860
Which, you know: Too bad.

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:38.350
As the only female titanic captain, it would
be like oda to match her up with Robin. And

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:42.040
in a way their abilities do seem to be quite
an interesting match up.

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:46.779
By the way, if I hit 700K subs by the end
of November, I will make a video about Shank’s

00:13:46.779 --> 00:13:51.800
crew and all the powers that Oda revealed
with film red, so hit subscribe if you want

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:52.800
to see that.

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:58.850
Number 4 is another impel down escape, the
colossal battleship: Sanjuan Wolf.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:04.199
This character is fascinating in lot of ways.
For one he is the largest character in the

00:14:04.199 --> 00:14:10.029
entire story, barely fitting on an island
and usually seen towering somewhere in the

00:14:10.029 --> 00:14:14.589
background. I mean look at this thing. He
also is the only known giant in the story

00:14:14.589 --> 00:14:19.110
so far, that has eaten a devil fruit. And
while we don’t excatly know what that devil

00:14:19.110 --> 00:14:22.850
fruit is, it does seem to make him bigger.
*

00:14:22.850 --> 00:14:29.050
As giants tend to get very old, with 99 Years
is is the oldest member of the crew. His name

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:32.839
could be based on the spanish warship, the
San Juan Nepomuceno.

00:14:32.839 --> 00:14:39.970
Somehow he is also one of the 10 titanic captains,
though i don’t know how he fits on any ship.

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:47.339
Maybe he can also shrink himself after all.
We know nothing about his powers, but he does

00:14:47.339 --> 00:14:53.170
look quite powerful, even if, remember boys
and girls: size isn’t everything. But it

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:55.759
sure leaves an impression, if you know what
I’m saying.

00:14:55.759 --> 00:15:00.310
My best match up for Wolf would be franky,
a character that also has a gigantous robot

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:05.889
at his disposal and after leaving from vegapunks
lab might very well have upgraded to something

00:15:05.889 --> 00:15:11.680
even bigger and more impressive than shogun
franky, that can keep up with San Juan Wolf’s

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:13.209
unfathomable size.

00:15:13.209 --> 00:15:18.040
Number 3 is vasco shot. And out of a crew
of people we know very little about, he is

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:23.709
by far the worst. The only two things we know
about this character are that he drinks a

00:15:23.709 --> 00:15:30.190
lot and that he has the longest nose of any
other one piece character. Yeah that’s it.

00:15:30.190 --> 00:15:35.280
I have high expectations that his powers must
be something incredibly powerful and entertaining.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:42.520
I’m a big fan of drunken fist and other
unpredictable abilities of that sort. Just

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:48.069
like the other level 6 inmates that Blackbeard
recruited, his name seems to be based on another

00:15:48.069 --> 00:15:54.510
spanish conquistador, Vasco Nuñez de balboa
and shot probably just refers to doing shots.

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:55.510
*

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:59.930
The only straw hat without a matchup here
is Brook, so i’m just going to go with that.

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:05.740
Not chopper of course, because at number 2
we have the God of death: Doc Q.

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:10.980
Doc Q has eaten the shiku shiku no mi, literally
the sick sick fruit, that allows him to infect

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:16.370
his opponents with disease, that apparently
he can come up with himself, including apparently

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:22.019
something called ‘turning into a woman sickness’.
Which makes me wonder if Usopp’s I can’t

00:16:22.019 --> 00:16:27.500
go on that island sickness might not become
relevant again at some point in the story.

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:32.750
A very fitting for a character that has been
chronically sick his entire life, but also

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:36.430
sort of ironic, given that he’s the crew’s
doctor.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:41.630
His pale and sick horse that is fittingly
named stronger, has eaten the mythical pegasus

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:44.190
zoan fruit, giving him the ability to fly.

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:48.690
As quirky as this pair is, we all know that
they are quite powerful and despite their

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:54.209
pitiful appearance they love to torment people,
as we saw with Doc Q giving out explosive

00:16:54.209 --> 00:16:55.209
apples.

00:16:55.209 --> 00:17:01.130
The inspiration for his character is two fold:
Doc Q fits the description of death, the fourth

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:07.000
horseman from Revelation, also known as the
apocalypse. Death" is described as a gaunt

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:13.439
figure who rides a sickly and pale horse spreading
desease. Very fitting. And of course the snow

00:17:13.439 --> 00:17:15.819
white posiened apple story as well.

00:17:15.819 --> 00:17:21.020
but interestingly enough, Doc Q also shares
a lot of similarities with Doctor Hiruluk,

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:26.980
chopper’s mentor. They have a very similar
face and hair color, both first appeared on

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:33.669
drum island, both are criminals, a conman
and a pirate and both have a love for chemicals.

00:17:33.669 --> 00:17:39.610
While doc q infuses apples so that his victims
explode, Hiruluk drank a chemical, that also

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:41.309
made his body explode.

00:17:41.309 --> 00:17:46.799
As a result the only acceptable opponent for
Doc Q and Stronger is of course chopper, who

00:17:46.799 --> 00:17:52.020
will have to face a dark and twisted version
of his mentor and fatherfigure.

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:57.520
Which brings us all the way to number one:
The admiral of the Blackbeard pirates, the

00:17:57.520 --> 00:18:03.809
man himself: Marshall D. Teach.
As you know, blackbeaerd has eaten 2 devil

00:18:03.809 --> 00:18:08.230
